# =================================================================
# 🛡️ MOOMOO & 富途牛牛 终极全量无死角分流规则 (2026 最新版)
# =================================================================

# >>>>>>>>>> [第一层：应用特征全拦截] <<<<<<<<<<
# 只要是 Moomoo 或 富途牛牛 App 发出的流量，无视任何域名/IP，直接强制抓取
USER-AGENT,moomoo*,PROXY
USER-AGENT,Futu*,PROXY
USER-AGENT,Moomoo*,PROXY
USER-AGENT,Futubull*,PROXY
PROCESS-NAME,Moomoo,PROXY
PROCESS-NAME,Futubull,PROXY

# >>>>>>>>>> [第二层：全量泛域名及衍生壳域名] <<<<<<<<<<
# 包含所有主权国家注册的本地化壳域名、OpenAPI、量化交易及测试环境
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,moomoo,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,futunn,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,futu5,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,futuip,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,futuapi,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,moomoo.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,moomooq.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,moomooapp.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,futunn.com,PROXY
